  "description": "Jeong Seo-un, 32 years old, dominant omega. Six years into his career, and several relationships behind him. The beginnings were always exciting, but the endings always left him drained. By the time he realized even emotions required stamina, a man he met for the first time on a blind date suddenly proposed. Ahn I-jin, 31 years old, dominant alpha. His expressionless eyes reveal nothing, his tone excessively polite. Something about him seems suspicious—yet the conditions are good, and on top of that, he has a sculpted face... exactly Seo-un’s type. And so begins a practical marriage, stripped of feelings. But as the days together accumulate, emotions start to intertwine, and a spark of excitement begins to bloom once again… Amidst worn-out hearts, the clumsy love of two people starts anew.\nSource: MU",
